        "idCapDrop": "idCapDrop=(\\d+)",
        "idUnbilled": "idUnbilled=(\\d+)",
        "idOpen": "idOpen=(\\d+)",
        "idPending": "idPending=(\\d+)",
        "visitAvg": "visitAvgMin=([0-9.]+)",
        "visitMax": "visitMaxMin=([0-9.]+)",
        "visitN": "visitN=(\\d+)"
      },
      "note": "THE OWNER'S TABLE ROW, and the fold's assertion: the ACCOUNTING IDENTITY holds (idUnbilled=0 - every entry that came due is billed, on the floor, a no-sale, or a native capacity drop) and the floor never went over the shop's capacity."
    },
